# A hosted table on the local platform, the guest's side (bob, desktop):
# Hosted Play, Quick join alice's table, then play by keys to the result.
# viewport 1280x720@1
until 900 =Hosted Play
frames 60
click =Hosted Play
until 300 =Quick join
frames 10
click =Quick join
until 600 =Leave
frames 10
save online-guest-lobby
until 3000 Hosted table
frames 60
save online-guest-play
repeat 4000 until =Round over
  key ArrowRight 1
  frames 3
  key Enter 1
  frames 12
  key KeyD 1
  frames 25
end
frames 30
save online-guest-results
expect result recorded by the StarHermit server
